Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,100)}What if every human on Earth vanished… right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:05.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,100)}Within hours, the lights go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,100)}All over the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:09.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,100)}Two days later, the New York subway floods.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:11.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,100)}The pumps have stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:16.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,100)}In twenty years, roads crack open, and trees push through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:21.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,100)}In three hundred years, the Eiffel Tower rusts… and falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,100)}In five hundred, forests have swallowed our cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:29.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,100)}But one thing we made will stay for thousands of years…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:31.70,Big,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,100)}OUR PLASTIC.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:34.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,100)}Would Earth even miss us?
